<div class="py-4">
  <div class="window p-0">
    <div class="title-bar">
      <div class="title-bar-text">My Toolbox &mdash; Explorer</div>
    </div>

    <div class="window-toolbar">
      <span>File</span>
      <span>Edit</span>
      <span>View</span>
      <span>Help</span>
    </div>

    <div class="window-body m-0">
      <div class="table-responsive">
        <table class="w-100">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Tool</th>
              <th>What I use it for</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 py-2">
                  <%= image_tag "icons/32px/disk-pink.png", alt: "", class: "flex-shrink-0 pixel-icon", style: "height: 1.75rem; width: 1.75rem; object-fit: contain;" %>
                  <div>
                    <p class="fw-bold mb-0">Ruby on Rails</p>
                    <span class="chip98" style="font-size: 11px; padding: 1px 6px;">Main</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </td>
              <td class="text-secondary">My main framework for building web apps</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 py-2">
                  <%= image_tag "icons/32px/disk-blue.png", alt: "", class: "flex-shrink-0 pixel-icon", style: "height: 1.75rem; width: 1.75rem; object-fit: contain;" %>
                  <p class="fw-bold mb-0">PostgreSQL</p>
                </div>
              </td>
              <td class="text-secondary">Databases and data modeling</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 py-2">
                  <%= image_tag "icons/32px/disk-purple.png", alt: "", class: "flex-shrink-0 pixel-icon", style: "height: 1.75rem; width: 1.75rem; object-fit: contain;" %>
                  <div>
                    <p class="fw-bold mb-0">Bootstrap</p>
                    <span class="chip98" style="font-size: 11px; padding: 1px 6px;">Favorite</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </td>
              <td class="text-secondary">My go-to for fast, clean layouts</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 py-2">
                  <%= image_tag "icons/32px/disk-mint.png", alt: "", class: "flex-shrink-0 pixel-icon", style: "height: 1.75rem; width: 1.75rem; object-fit: contain;" %>
                  <p class="fw-bold mb-0">Tailwind CSS</p>
                </div>
              </td>
              <td class="text-secondary">Utility-first styling when a project uses it</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="terminal98">
        C:\&gt; type currently_learning.txt&nbsp; Sharpening my business logic skills: writing Rails code that models real-world rules clearly.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
